{"ID":"20260206202357-gdymd2a","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f383","id":"20260206202357-gdymd2a","tags":"CNN,神经网络基础学习,经典卷积神经网络架构","title":"DenseNet","type":"doc","updated":"20260206202739"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206202414-ybrt1h9","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-ybrt1h9","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206202414-powk14b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-powk14b","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DenseNet是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Gao Huang"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等人于2018年在论文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Densely Connected Convolutional Network"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中提出的新架构。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-1wqpy45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-1wqpy45","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一个非常反常识的事情需要进行阐述，网络结构虽然称作密集连接的卷积神经网络，但他的参数量和计算量并不高，甚至比前一代的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还要低上许多。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-rxkwxam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-rxkwxam","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然这个网络架构最主要的启发当然是著作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啦。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-ejtsw93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-ejtsw93","updated":"20260206202435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"height: 33vh;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126091948068"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-3693258-20260127090737441-1446277935-20260206202422-dmtvtyj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"height: 33vh;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-k2g19es","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-k2g19es","updated":"20260206202621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 模型创作背景"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-4spdm7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-4spdm7h","updated":"20260206202609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2017"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192508-7vlgudd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"横空出世，在当时泛起了轩然大波。超级深的卷积神经网络在进行运算过程中产生的梯度爆炸或者是梯度消失等问题几乎得到了完美的解决。不仅仅是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192508-7vlgudd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，包括"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"HighwayNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等诸多架构都使用了残差连接这种方式在提高网络深度的同时尽可能的降低模型退化的概率。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-9tspsiq","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-9tspsiq","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206202414-aejfm2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-aejfm2n","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里模型的退化，主要就是随着网络深度的增加，模型训练精度不降反升的一种奇怪的现象。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-weofb9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-weofb9z","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是本文作者认为，网络一味的提升网络深度是没有多大必要的。原因主要有下面两点："}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-ufr39ea","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-ufr39ea","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206202414-esw3ipq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-esw3ipq","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206202414-ylvqmpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-ylvqmpz","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络深度增加，哪怕你的模型架构再好，训练过程中的计算量和数据量一定会呈指数级别的上升。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-bbg17ka","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-bbg17ka","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206202414-c32nkfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-c32nkfq","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络的深度增加，最前面输入的特征早就已经被冲淡了。那网络的增加还有什么意义呢？"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-05qy4io","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-05qy4io","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206202414-nqyf4sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-nqyf4sr","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原文中的表述为：当相关的输入或者是梯度的信息传过了很多中间层的时候，这些信息在网络最后基本上早已被冲淡或者是直接消失。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-i7t64ky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-i7t64ky","updated":"20260206202621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此在这个背景之下作者主要就是想要解决上面这两个问题，并设计除了一种新的模型架构"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DenseNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"架构，这个架构的设计构想主要来源于"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192508-7vlgudd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192147-45jp7aq","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-g3ctg5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-g3ctg5b","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前者主要就是对其短接的残差连接进行思考，后者当然就是块的方式进行类似。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-za0bhyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-za0bhyi","updated":"20260206202446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126093641172"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-3693258-20260127090740984-371388090-20260206202423-2gxcaai.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-vahb9ax","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-vahb9ax","updated":"20260206202716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 模型整体架构"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-o69ei53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-o69ei53","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"作者提出的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DenseNet(密集连接的卷积神经网络)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个网络通过将每一层和其他所有在它之后的层相互连接的方式来消除深度带来的信息消失的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-zup7rog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-zup7rog","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个方法作者认为是特征复用。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-gyofh14","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-gyofh14","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206202414-mtvf3zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-mtvf3zw","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原本特征就来之不易，直接给人家消去了多不好，因此留几个备份，给后面几个人都看一下，看看我最开始的到底是个什么样子，毕竟一手消息，和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"N"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多手消息是不一样的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-wa2hd34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-wa2hd34","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个网络的单个连接层就如下所示。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-4ylzd26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-4ylzd26","updated":"20260206202452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"height: 33vh;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126094306052"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-3693258-20260127090743478-693901607-20260206202423-u1myeqa.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"height: 33vh;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-hs2bq06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-hs2bq06","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它相较于ResNet主要有下面几个改进："}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-ijjm3b7","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-ijjm3b7","updated":"20260206202701"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206202414-wgb5qg2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-wgb5qg2","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206202414-bq5jznn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-bq5jznn","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不仅仅只是一次线条进行短接，而是将每个网络的输入于之后所有网络的输入均相互短接在一起，增强特征的重复使用。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-w8jtf1c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-w8jtf1c","updated":"20260206202635"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206202414-nttup52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-nttup52","updated":"20260206202635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前的短接是直接将两个网络的特征直接相加y "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" F(x) + x，现在做的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Concat"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的操作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"y = torch.cat(F(x) , x)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，将特征图叠在一起。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-kv15g6k","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-kv15g6k","updated":"20260206202701"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206202414-pgdsw3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-pgdsw3r","updated":"20260206202701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每一次无论输入的通道数是多少都保证他们有相同的输出通道，同时将这个输出通道定义为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"K"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个的作用是什么呢：对于第一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"H"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而言输入三个通道，输出32个通道；对于第二个H而言输入的就是32+3个通道，输出是32个通道；那么以此类推，对于第N个通道，他的输入就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"3+32\\times N"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 个通道数量。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-zz9x0em","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-zz9x0em","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206202414-rx4izo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-rx4izo6","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每一"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Dense"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层的主要结构是一次卷积，一次全局归一化，以及一次非线性激活函数组成的："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-smyw0g4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-smyw0g4","updated":"20260206202456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126095445098"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-3693258-20260127090746207-2036706627-20260206202423-jy5gow5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-jeaiip6","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-jeaiip6","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206202414-xi6ylf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-xi6ylf6","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而每一层的中间过渡层是通过一次卷积，一次全局归一化，以及全局平均池化组成的："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-a7eea6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-a7eea6i","updated":"20260206202458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126095610585"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-3693258-20260127090748169-652127506-20260206202423-cub9lzs.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-irfbgyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-irfbgyd","updated":"20260206202716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在将上面的两个模块分别进行命名称作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Dense_{layer}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Dense_{transition}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，分别对应前者与后者。那么最终的一个Dense块儿就是由这两个相互组成的"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-l242snj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-l242snj","updated":"20260206202716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"height: 50vh;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126095956928"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-3693258-20260127090749931-1278368735-20260206202424-8j2k6i0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"height: 50vh;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-6gduqqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-6gduqqi","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这两个模块的组成就对应了中间的函数"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"H"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个用来做标准的稠密连接Dense的主要，另一个就是为了将通道数减半降低运算量。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-2tvblc3","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-2tvblc3","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206202414-05aqb9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-05aqb9z","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前者解决了深度增加冲淡信息的问题，后者解决了深度增大计算资源过大的问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-tes9uo6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-tes9uo6","updated":"20260206202739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 模型代码实现"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-ugbhc9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-ugbhc9m","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么有了上面的解释就可以对这个进行编写了，主要用的就是基本的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Pytorch"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"架构来编写"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-sfl0ecv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-sfl0ecv","updated":"20260206202728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先编写一下"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Dense_{layer}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​这个层吧。"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-v745h90","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-v745h90","updated":"20260206202513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":" def dense_layer(in_channels , out_channels , bn_size = 4 , drop_rate = 0.5):\n     return (\n         nn.Sequential(\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace = True),\n             nn.Conv2d(\n                 in_channels = in_channels , \n                 out_channels = bn_size * out_channels, \n                 kernel_size = 1 , \n                 padding = 0 , \n                 stride = 1\n                 ),\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(bn_size * out_channels),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace = True),\n             nn.Conv2d(\n                 in_channels = bn_size * out_channels , \n                 out_channels = out_channels , \n                 kernel_size = 3 , \n                 padding = 1 , \n                 stride = 1\n                 ),\n             nn.Dropout(p = drop_rate) if drop_rate \u003e 0 else nn.Identity()\n         )\n     )\n ​\n # x = torch.randn(4 , 3 , 32 , 32)\n # layer = dense_layer(3 , 32)\n # print(layer(x).shape)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-bjek59s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-bjek59s","updated":"20260206202739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其次编写一下中间用来过渡的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Dense_{transition}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​层"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-gs2umg5","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-gs2umg5","updated":"20260206202524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":" def dense_transition(in_channels , out_channels):\n     return (\n         nn.Sequential(\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace = True),\n             nn.Conv2d(\n                 in_channels=in_channels , \n                 out_channels=out_channels,\n                 kernel_size=1,\n                 padding = 0 ,\n                 stride=1\n             ),\n             nn.AvgPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n         )\n     )\n ​\n # x = torch.randn(4 , 64 , 32 , 32)\n # layer = dense_transition(64 , 32)\n # print(layer(x).shape)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-evvlo5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-evvlo5b","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后将整一个Dense块儿给他搞一下"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-9tv7wjf","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-9tv7wjf","updated":"20260206202528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":" class DenseBlock(nn.Module):\n     def __init__(self , num_layers , in_channels ,  growth_rate = 32):\n         super(DenseBlock , self).__init__()\n         self.num_layers = num_layers\n         layers = []\n         for i in range (self.num_layers):\n             layer = dense_layer(\n                 in_channels= in_channels +i * growth_rate,\n                 out_channels= growth_rate\n             )\n             layers.append(layer)\n         self.layers = nn.Sequential(*layers)\n ​\n     def forward(self , x):\n         for layer in self.layers:\n             y = layer(x)\n             x = torch.cat([x , y] , dim =1)\n         return x\n ​\n # x = torch.randn(4 , 2 , 32 , 32)\n # layer = DenseBlock(num_layers=1 , in_channels=2 , growth_rate=32)\n # layer(x).size()\n         \n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-1y9z7kk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-1y9z7kk","updated":"20260206202414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DenseNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的结构就出来了"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-hlfgdqn","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-hlfgdqn","updated":"20260206202530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":" class DenseNet(nn.Module):\n     def __init__(self , growth_rate = 32 , num_classes = 10 , in_channels = 3 , init_features = 64):\n         super(DenseNet , self).__init__()\n ​\n         # 初始卷积层\n         self.init_conv = nn.Sequential(\n             nn.Conv2d(\n                 in_channels= in_channels ,\n                 out_channels = init_features ,\n                 kernel_size = 7 ,\n                 stride = 2 ,\n                 padding = 3\n                 ),\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(init_features),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace = True),\n             nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3 , stride=2 , padding=1),\n             )\n         \n         # 密集块和过度层\n         num_channels = init_features\n         self.block1 = DenseBlock(num_layers = 6 , in_channels = num_channels , growth_rate = growth_rate)\n         num_channels = num_channels + 6 * growth_rate\n         self.trans1 = dense_transition(in_channels = num_channels , out_channels = num_channels // 2)\n         num_channels = num_channels // 2\n ​\n         self.block2 = DenseBlock(num_layers = 12 , in_channels = num_channels , growth_rate = growth_rate)\n         num_channels = num_channels + 12 * growth_rate\n         self.trans2 = dense_transition(in_channels = num_channels , out_channels = num_channels // 2)\n         num_channels = num_channels // 2\n ​\n         self.block3 = DenseBlock(num_layers = 24 , in_channels = num_channels , growth_rate = growth_rate)\n         num_channels = num_channels + 24 * growth_rate\n         self.trans3 = dense_transition(in_channels = num_channels , out_channels = num_channels // 2)\n         num_channels = num_channels // 2\n ​\n         self.block4 = DenseBlock(num_layers = 16 , in_channels = num_channels , growth_rate = growth_rate)\n         num_channels = num_channels + 16 * growth_rate\n ​\n         # 全局平均池化和分类层\n         self.global_avg_pool = nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d((1 , 1))\n         self.classifier = nn.Linear(num_channels , num_classes)\n ​\n     def forward(self , x):\n         x = self.init_conv(x)\n         x = self.block1(x)\n         x = self.trans1(x)\n         x = self.block2(x)\n         x = self.trans2(x)\n         x = self.block3(x)\n         x = self.trans3(x)\n         x = self.block4(x)\n         x = self.global_avg_pool(x)\n         x = torch.flatten(x, 1)\n         x = self.classifier(x)\n         return x\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206202414-lnkkffd","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-lnkkffd","updated":"20260206202542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206202414-qzhcq7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202414-qzhcq7q","updated":"20260206202542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DenseNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应该说是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192508-7vlgudd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的一种变体，它虽然是在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的基础上进行改进的但是仍然具有很大的数据量，今后的使用较少。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206202533-mv8b1wg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206202533-mv8b1wg","updated":"20260206202533"}}]}